"source_term":"豫章王妃庾氏","pei_kin_frame":"yu-spouse"},"status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-020","source_id":"s-nanqishu-020-peihuizhao-ws2074177","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-020-peihuizhao","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-020-peihuizhao:p002","quote":"后少與豫章王妃庾氏為娣姒，庾氏勤女工，奉事太祖、昭后恭謹不倦，后不能及，故不為舅姑所重，世祖家好亦薄焉。性剛嚴，竟陵王子良妃袁氏布衣時有過，后加訓罰。昇明三年，為齊世子妃。建元元年，為皇太子妃。三年，后薨。諡穆妃，葬休安陵。世祖即位，追尊皇后。贈璣之金紫光祿大夫，后母檀氏餘杭廣昌鄉元君。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-020-peihuizhao:p002:m0007","object_person_reference_id":"c-nanqishu-020-peihuizhao:p002:r0003"}],"interpretation_note":"依固定原句核對稱謂及親屬方向。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"a-nanshi-011-peihuizhao-yu-spouse","subject_person_id":"v9d_w9p_fij","object_person_id":"ijh_3fs_6u2","predicate":"spouse","qualifiers":{"source_term":"豫章王妃庾氏","pei_kin_frame":"yu-spouse"},"status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-011","source_id":"s-nanshi-011-peihuizhao-ws2288359","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-011-peihuizhao","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-011-peihuizhao:p001","quote":"武穆裴皇后諱惠昭，河東聞喜人也。祖封之，給事中。父璣之，左軍參軍。后少與豫章王妃庾氏為娣姒，庾氏勤女工，奉事高昭後恭謹不倦，后不能及，故不為舅姑所重，武帝亦薄焉。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-011-peihuizhao:p001:m0040","object_person_reference_id":"c-nanshi-011-peihuizhao:p001:r0036"}],"interpretation_note":"依固定原句核對稱謂及親屬方向。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"a-nanshi-042-yuzhang-wangfei-spouse","subject_person_id":"v9d_w9p_fij","object_person_id":"ijh_3fs_6u2","predicate":"spouse","qualifiers":{"source_term":"妃庾氏，有女功婦德，嶷甚重之","pei_kin_frame":"spouse"},"status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-042","source_id":"s-nanshi-042-yuzhang-wangfei-ws1570320","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-042-yuzhang-wangfei","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-042-yuzhang-wangfei:p001","quote":"妃庾氏，有女功婦德，嶷甚重之。宋時，武帝及嶷位宦尚輕，家又貧薄，庾氏常徹己損身，以相營奉。兄弟每行來公事，晚還饑疲，躬營飲食，未嘗不迎時先辦。雖豐儉隨事，而香淨適口。穆皇后不自營，又不整潔，上亦以此貴之。又不妒忌，嶷倍加敬重。嶷薨後，少時亦亡。","subject_pe