baoming:p002","text":"宋世，太祖為文惠太子納后，桂陽賊至，太祖在新亭，傳言已沒，宅復為人所抄掠，文惠太子、竟陵王子良奉穆后、庾妃及后挺身送后兄昺之家，事平乃出。建元元年，為南郡王妃。四年，為皇太子妃，無寵。太子為宮人製新麗衣裳及首飾，而后牀帷陳設故舊，釵鑷十餘枚。永明十一年，為皇太孫太妃。鬱林即位，尊為皇太后，稱宣德宮。贈后父金紫光祿大夫，母桓氏豐安縣君。其年十二月，備法駕謁太廟。高宗即位，出居鄱陽王故第，為宣德宮。永元三年，梁王定京邑，迎后入宮稱制，至禪位。天監十一年，薨，年五十八。葬崇安陵。諡曰安后。兄晃義興太守。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming:p002:m0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"太祖","person_id":"47p_kjh_ez7","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依傳內所指，鄱陽王鏘封號及卒事另見齊紀。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming:p002:m0006","start":6,"end":10,"surface":"文惠太子","person_id":"ipq_o9t_wdh","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依傳內所指，鄱陽王鏘封號及卒事另見齊紀。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming:p002:m0011","start":11,"end":12,"surface":"后","person_id":"m9u_v4i_tk5","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依傳內所指，鄱陽王鏘封號及卒事另見齊紀。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming:p002:m0013","start":13,"end":16,"surface":"桂陽賊","person_id":"fjv_3dz_w0m","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本傳人名、親稱與役事辨識。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming:p002:m0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"太祖","person_id":"47p_kjh_ez7","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本傳人名、親稱與役事辨識。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming:p002:m0037","start":37,"end":41,"surface":"文惠太子","person_id":"ipq_o9t_wdh","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本傳人名、親稱與役事辨識。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming:p002:m0042","start":42,"end":47,"surface":"竟陵王子良","person_id":"x3q_cqm_dup","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本傳人名、親稱與役事辨識。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming:p002:m0048","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"穆后","person_id":"262_b8f_4ie_AA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本傳人名、親稱與役事辨識。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming:p002:m0051","st